5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. To ensure our plans are realistic and kind to those who execute them, I shall look into the weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy to be part of this committee! To make sure we're making the best choices for everyone, I'd like to look into the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the post-occupancy review ratings!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we must consider the operational burden on our people. I will look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that we need a comprehensive view. To understand which past projects actually served the users well and which fell short, I will examine the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems the human and temporal elements are well-covered. To ensure our ambitions align with financial reality, I shall examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see such a thoughtful distribution of tasks. I believe that by combining your financial and operational insights with my look at the timelines, we shall find a truly sustainable path forward.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I totally agree, Shizue! It's so exciting that we're all looking at different things. I can't wait to see what we find out so we can help everyone on campus have a great space to work in!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I agree. A comprehensive approach is the only way to ensure we don't overlook the practical realities of our current operations. I look forward to seeing how our findings intersect.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a balanced approach. By examining both the user experience and the operational constraints, we can avoid repeating past mistakes. I look forward to seeing if the data reflects the actual needs of the campus.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most optimistic sentiment, Yumi. I shall await the revelations of the archives with a measured curiosity, hoping the numbers prove as cooperative as our collective spirit. Until we reconvene, I wish you all a productive investigation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe we have a very clear plan. I shall leave you all to your research now, and I look forward to hearing your discoveries when we return. May your findings be illuminating.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I'm so ready to dive in and see how we can make things better for everyone. See you all soon! Good luck with your research!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"I concur. We have a solid division of labor. I shall proceed with my investigation and return with the facts. Until then, I wish you all a productive search.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We have a clear path forward. I will begin my review of the user feedback and survey data now. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite. Since we have reached a consensus with such remarkable efficiency, I shall also declare myself ready. Let us see if the financial records are as transparent as our intentions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
