21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall also say over. I wish you all a peaceful and fruitful afternoon of study. I look forward to our next meeting with a warm heart.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
