23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm over too! I'll do my absolute best to find some helpful information for everyone. See you all in the next round! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
